msgid "**Formats:**"
msgstr "**형식:**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:538
msgid "*Images:* See :ref:`doc_importing_images`."
msgstr "*이미지:* :ref:`doc_importing_images`\\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:539
