#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:419
msgid ""
"Each time an enemy hits the player, the signal is going to be emitted. We "
"need to disable the player's collision so that we don't trigger the ``hit`` "
"signal more than once."
msgstr ""
"적이 플레이어를 칠 때마다 시그널이 방출됩니다. 우리는 두 번 이상 ``hit`` 시그"
"널이 발동되지 않도록 플레이어의 콜리전을 비활성화 해야 합니다."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:423
msgid ""
"Disabling the area's collision shape can cause an error if it happens in the "
