#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:44
msgid ""
"Godot 4 does not and will not have support for GLES2 rendering. (There is "
"still support for GLES3 rendering using the new Compatibility renderer, "
"which means that devices without Vulkan support can still run Godot 4.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:48
msgid ""
